{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, in the far edge of the galaxy, lies Octopa \u2014 a tiny planet with only two things: strange creatures and something they call \u201cYasai.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, the people of Octopa have piled up a massive debt they can\u2019t repay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So they have summoned you to help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To earn money, you\u2019ll need vegetables that can be sold to humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture and raise odd creatures, grow Yasai on the farm, and work toward clearing the debt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the coins you earn to unlock skills and improve efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy more eggs with Love, expand your farm, and watch the creatures go about their charming little lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax, leave the game running, or just enjoy watching their world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Octopa is counting on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work uses sound effects from the <strong>OtoLogic</strong> sound library.<br>BGM by mi!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4138740?t=1765491975","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4138740?t=1765491975","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/b25917bc03d4669a1d2176ad9ac954155ca848d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765491975","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/b25917bc03d4669a1d2176ad9ac954155ca848d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765491975","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_d